-.. title:: clang-tidy - android-cloexec-fopen
-
-android-cloexec-fopen
-=====================
-
-``fopen()`` should include ``e`` in their mode string; so ``re`` would be
-valid. This is equivalent to having set ``FD_CLOEXEC on`` that descriptor.
-
-Examples:
-
-.. code-block:: c++
-
-  fopen("fn", "r");
-
-  // becomes
-
-  fopen("fn", "re");
-
